                <pre class="text-green-400 text-sm"><code>&lt;!-- Basic native lazy loading --&gt;
&lt;img src="image.jpg" loading="lazy" alt="Description" /&gt;

&lt;!-- With dimensions to prevent CLS --&gt;
&lt;img 
  src="image.jpg" 
  loading="lazy" 
  width="400" 
  height="300"
  alt="Description" 
/&gt;

&lt;!-- Don't lazy load above-the-fold images --&gt;
&lt;img src="hero.jpg" loading="eager" alt="Hero image" /&gt;</code></pre>
              </div>
